 leaves every observed order gate unchanged. Both Pine backends and the independent calendar and equity calculations match all 1,484 daily observations.","BTC preserves the archived chart dates and Binance Futures instrument. ETH and the equal forward window supply reference comparisons. Both assets use the authored 100%-equity rule and a 10,000 USDT accounting base because the archive leaves starting equity implicit."]},"reporting_model":["Venue-denominated P&L uses realized closes and the comparison fee in each row. Net deducts the project 0.03% execution buffer per fill. Unclosed positions are reported separately. USD and USDT results retain their respective quotes."],"source_audits":{"409":{"archive_settings":{},"source_document_sha256":"3646ba09eff31051ac46b70cd39de03f896cda48e132bb282e688961fa9d6591","closed":57},"4755":{"archive_settings":{"start":"2022-11-16 00:00:00","end":"2023-11-22 00:00:00","period":"1d","basePeriod":"1h","exchanges":"[{\"eid\":\"Futures_Binance\",\"currency\":\"BTC_USDT\"}]"},"source_document_sha256":"9390b39a667178dd0a4061c16c57efd1a3faa86436deb3ac82ba9eff02a8558f","closed":3}},"per_case_order_counts":[{"id":409,"period":"USD research year 1","market":"BTCUSD","closed":16,"open_at_cutoff":0,"chart_bars":364,"witnesses_checked":3640,"entry_signal_bars":72,"exit_signal_bars":66},{"id":409,"period":"USD research year 1","market":"ETHUSD","closed":15,"open_at_cutoff":0,"chart_bars":364,"witnesses_checked":3640,"entry_signal_bars":78,"exit_signal_bars":64},{"id":409,"period":"USD research year 2","market":"BTCUSD","closed":13,"open_at_cutoff":1,"chart_bars":364,"witnesses_checked":3640,"entry_signal_bars":67,"exit_signal_bars":71},{"id":409,"period":"USD research year 2","market":"ETHUSD","closed":13,"open_at_cutoff":0,"chart_bars":364,"witnesses_checked":3640,"entry_signal_bars":75,"exit_signal_bars":66},{"id":4755,"period":"FMZ native window","market":"BTCUSDT","closed":1,"open_at_cutoff":1,"chart_bars":371,"witnesses_checked":2226,"entr